Ensure Pixhawk and Jetson are powered.

====Connect Jetson -> pX========
-- via WIFI(ESP)
Connect Jetson to Pixhawk ESP wifi network 
  SSID CraneAero
  Pass craneaero

-- Via USB
Connect Jetson to Pixhawk USB-C Cable 

-- Via UART
connect serial connection adaptor to serial 2 port on PX
connect serial connection adaptor to uart1 port on Jetson (https://forums.developer.nvidia.com/t/how-to-access-uart1-on-expansion-pins-8-10/328934/6)
set Serial _Baud Param to 921600 (921) and write params



======Launch MAVPROXY Link =========
--via Wifi
Open Terminal
$ mavproxy.py --master=0.0.0.0:14552 --out udp:127.0.0.1:14540
  can add the following suffix for certain windows
  --map (launches a map window)
  --console (launches a console window)

--via USB
Open Terminal
$ mavproxy.py --master=/dev/ttyACM0 --out udp:127.0.0.1:14540
  can add the following suffixx for certain windows
  --map (launches a map window)
  --console (launches a console window)

--via UART
Open Terminal
$ mavproxy.py --master=/dev/ttyTHS1,921600 --out udp:127.0.0.1:14540
  can add the following suffixx for certain windows
  --map (launches a map window)
  --console (launches a console window)


To get Mavros:
In one terminal :
  mavproxy.py --master=/dev/ttyTHS1,921600 --out udp:127.0.0.1:14540 --console
In a second one:

  ros2 launch mavros apm.launch fcu_url:=udp://@127.0.0.1:14540
or
  ros2 launch mavros apm.launch fcu_url:=udp://0.0.0.0:14540@
